avatar-local
============
Wraps (does not modify):
  SadTalker — https://github.com/OpenTalker/SadTalker — Apache-2.0 (third-party components listed in its LICENSE), vendored at setup time into vendor/
  F5-TTS — https://github.com/SWivid/F5-TTS — MIT (model weights F5TTS_v1_Base, CC-BY-NC-4.0 per HF model card: personal/research use)
  face_alignment (BSD-3), facexlib (MIT, weights for detection/parsing), torch/torchvision (BSD)
shim/gfpgan is a local stub so SadTalker imports without gfpgan/basicsr; no GFPGAN code is used.
Files authored here (MIT): app.py ui.html selftest.py setup.sh pack.sh README.md
Usage rule: only your own or explicitly consented face/voice; no face swap is implemented.
